        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86713, Keaton Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keaton Finger Cabinet Pull can be mounted vertically or horizontally for a look that suits your style and needs. This Modern Cabinet Knob is available in a wide array of finish colors. The Keaton Cabinet Knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86713-specifications.gif?v=1704354728\" width=\"367\" height=\"219\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86173 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/keaton-cabinet-pull-emtek-86714\"><b>Emtek Keaton Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/keaton-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86721\"><b>Emtek Keaton Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Keaton Cabinet Finger Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Grip Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
